Our banners march in the same columns as the SPD's in Berlin, Leipzig and Chemnitz. The speakers on the platform are of three parties. For one afternoon, the working class looks like one class.

@defence
view-if: offensive_gone = 0
subtitle: The Left's line: the workers must defend the Republic themselves, since the Republic will not.
on-arrival: red_guards_strength += 3; red_guards_arms += 3; repression += 5; militancy += 4; offensive_satisfaction += 6; lean_offensive += 2

In Berlin and the Ruhr, factory defence squads are formed and drill in the evenings. The police watch them more closely than they ever watched the Organisation Consul.

@demand
subtitle: The Spartacist line: hold the government to its word, and expose it when it fails.
on-arrival: uspd_relation += 3; worker_support += 2; luxemburgist_satisfaction += 4; lean_luxemburgist += 1

Our deputies demand the dissolution of the Organisation Consul, the purge of the Reichswehr's officers and the trial of the nationalist editors who called for murder. The Reichstag passes some of it. Bavaria applies none of it.
